Yambera_Text_1:
	.string "Pfew…\n"
	.string "I really needed to rest.\p"
	.string "The weather in the desert can be\n"
	.string "rough from time to time.$"

Yambera_Text_2:
	.string "People are not very religious\n"
	.string "around YAMBERA.\p"
	.string "The church mainly serves as a\n"
	.string "wedding location for residents.\p"
	.string "Apart from that it’s some nice\n"
	.string "scenery for visitors.$"

Yambera_Text_3:
	.string "I decided to move to YAMBERA after\n"
	.string "my retirement.\p"
	.string "It’s the perfect village to enjoy\n"
	.string "peacefully.$"

Yambera_Text_4:
	.string "RALPH and EMILY?\p"
	.string "Oh, they have been competing with\n"
	.string "each other their whole life.\p"
	.string "On top of that they always catch\n"
	.string "similar POKéMON.$"

